                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Document</hi> E</head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Statement Regarding Employment of Foreign
                        Nationals</hi>
                </p>
                <p>It is recognized that the employment by either the U.S. or the U.K. on work
                    involving access to classified military information of individual nationals of
                    third countries is a matter entirely within the discretion of the employing
                    nation, which will be responsible for applying adequate security safeguards.</p>
            </div>
